Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:06:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure software identity and block-index startup
 completion

Publish software name/version as strings and preserve the signed wall-clock
millisecond interval with its exact existing width15. Keep Info level, OOM
handler ordering, index restart decisions, failure text and startup behavior.
The fresh-node fixture checks actual identity/timing JSON plus exact readable
text after height0 and clean shutdown. Rare OOM/index-restart failure paths
are not newly forced; focused native validation is pending.

